{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/StorePage_Category_01_english.png?t=1744961039\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/timeactionroguelike-optimize.gif?t=1744961039\" /><br>Ascend to ZERO is a time action roguelike that uses time freeze to wipe out enemies. Use your unique time freeze ability to save a world on the brink of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/StorePage_Category_02_english.png?t=1744961039\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/timestop-optimize.gif?t=1744961039\" />When you stop time, dodging attacks or evading enemies is entirely up to you. Anticipate, freeze, counterattack, and experience dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/StorePage_Category_04_english.png?t=1744961039\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/growth-optimize.gif?t=1744961039\" />Grow infinitely stronger by replaying the game. Level up in an instant and feel the thrill of overcoming your limits as you acquire powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/StorePage_Category_03_english.png?t=1744961039\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/characters-optimize.gif?t=1744961039\" />Realize the future that could have been yours and be reborn as a new avatar. Discover your own playstyle through unique skills and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey to correct past mistakes and build a new future begins now.\u00a0Are you ready to save the world in just 30 seconds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version introduces the beginning of the story and offers a glimpse of the full gameplay experience.\u00a0Get ready for a rich experience in the full version, where the world expands, and the challenges become more intense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279910?t=1744961039","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279910?t=1744961039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/691aa7b6192d871b40b044cce2230efa4eb9955e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744961039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/691aa7b6192d871b40b044cce2230efa4eb9955e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744961039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/StorePage_Category_01_english.png?t=1744961039\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/timeactionroguelike-optimize.gif?t=1744961039\" /><br>Ascend to ZERO is a time acti